# anchor: register on assign & organization role scope / Org role scope · Create an Organization whose founding member holds project-admin → 400
request: POST /v1/products/{{create-product.productId}}/organizations
request-headers: Content-Type, X-Product-Api-Key
request-body: {"name": "eptest-regassign-founding-{{$runId}}", "founding_member": {"product_user_id": "{{user-eve.id}}", "role_id": "{{role-project-admin.id}}"}}

status: 400
header Content-Type: application/json
header Vary: Origin
header X-Request-Id: ct/register-on-assign-organization-role-scope/scope-founding
header-names: Content-Type, Vary, X-Request-Id

body:
{"errors":[{"code":"ROLE_NOT_ORGANIZATION_SCOPED","message":"An Organization role must be scoped to organization. This role is scoped to project: assign it on a resource instead.","metadata":{"resource_type":"project","role_id":"{{role-project-admin.id}}"}}]}

